{{New Content}}
Particles is a late-game feature unlocked by purchasing Refine Node 137. It is the ninth sub-tab in Unity
There are 5 types of Particles: Alpha (α), Beta (β), Gamma (γ), Delta (δ), and Epsilon (ε). Only Alpha is unlocked at the start, each other Particle must be unlocked through their respective tier-up.

=== Particle Upgrades ===
Alpha through Gamma each come with the same set of 4 upgrades, each of which affect that particle's generation:
