=== Particle Prestige ===
Particle Prestige is a very simple mechanic where, if you have more than 1e20 of any particle, you can prestige it and its respective upgrades to boost the generation of the next particle. (i.e. Alpha boosts Beta when prestiged) Each boost starts at a base of 1x except for Delta's boost to Epsilon which starts at x0 instead. (the formula still jumps to 1 when prestige is available)

=== Epsilon ===
