==== Sparks ====
Epsilon can be used to spawn Sparks, at a base cost of 1000 Epsilon and increasing by 100 per Spark spawned. Each Spark has its own effect, determined based on 2 stats: Rarity and Mastery.

Rarity is very similar to that of ERs, as it presents itself more like a tier system. There are 14 rarities/tiers: F, E, D, C, C+, B, B+, A, A+, S, SS, SSS, 4S, and Star ('''★)'''. Of course, the chances of each rarity are determined by a seperate Spark Luck stat.
[[File:Sparks.png|thumb|Sparks]]
Mastery is gained when spawning a Spark, seen right above the Spawn button. It is very similar to Zodiac Quality.
