==== Epsilon Tree ====
[[File:Epsilon Tree.png|thumb|the Epsilon Tree]]
Unlocked along with Epsilon, here you can purchase Epsilon Tree Points, or ETP to spend on a large upgrade tree. It functions very similar to the Dilation Tree, each upgrade can instead be upgraded infinitely, and the upgrades towards the center require all previous upgrades to unlock and purchase. There is no way to respec the tree, but levels in tree nodes can be sold for an amount equal to half the price of your next ETP. Epsilon can also be "prestiged" here to increase its max instead.
